;; Named cyclic clusters of the module require graph: cluster name => anchor module.
;; The cluster holding the anchor carries the name; its members are computed, so it can grow and shrink freely.
;; metabase.core.module-cycles-test fails until every cluster holds exactly one anchor.
;; When a cluster splits, whoever split it names the new half. Names follow a space theme with some link to
;; what the cluster does; the name-module-cycle skill in .claude/skills helps pick one.
{first-contact   mcp
 foundation      app-db
 galactic-center query-processor
 rosetta         lib
 stargate        api-routes}
